		"ja": [
			"ガンダム・バルバトスルプス新形態がついに登場！",
			"• バルバトスの全高を超えるサイズの超大型メイスを装備。■握り手に加えて、平手状のハンドパーツも付属。■テイルブレードにはリード線を使用。両腕にはサブアームを内蔵し、展開可能。■超大型メイスのグリップは収縮し、腰部の装着可能。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Gundam Barbatos Lupus new form is finally here!",
			"• Equipped with a super large mace that exceeds Barbatos' total height. ■In addition to the gripping hand, palm-shaped hand parts are also included. ■Use lead wire for the tail blade. Both arms have built-in sub-arms that can be expanded. ■The grip of the super large mace retracts and can be worn on the waist."
		]
